_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667070/extras/Dillo_Worlds_Text_Box_1.png?t=1749505517\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667070/extras/GIF_Dillo_Worlds_First_20FPS.gif?t=1749505517\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore Two Vast Worlds and a Vibrant Hub</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover two different worlds \u2013 each packed with secrets, challenges, and hidden fireflies. Dive into mini-levels scattered across the overworld and return to your cozy home to prepare your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667070/extras/Dillo_Steam_Page_Thing_Diagonal_Lines.png?t=1749505517\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667070/extras/Dillo_Fort_GIF_Three.gif?t=1749505517\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Save Your Firefly Friends from the Rat King</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Rat King\u2019s minions have taken over your homeland. Pinpoint their forts across the land, plan your route, and launch strategic assaults to rescue your captured friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667070/extras/And_More_Text.png?t=1749505517\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Momentum-based movement through rolling and bouncing physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and ride through pinball contraptions of your own making.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two expansive worlds with layered mini-levels and a central Hub area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overworld forts to scout, plan, infiltrate, and destroy in your mission to save fireflies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A colorful, stylized world full of secrets, shortcuts, and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills and complete your collection by finding all the hidden fireflies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Coming Soon\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Jolly Cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with a friend in co-op mode or compete to conquer forts in record time. Whether working together or going head-to-head, only one can be the ultimate armadillo!</p>","developers":["MoonSpice Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667070/4769a32d7005e44b9d3deacf0c1a662308336c08/header.jpg?t=1749505517","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257154522,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154522/movie480.mp4?t=1749505512","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154522/movie_max.mp4?t=1749505512"},"name":"Dillo Second Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154522/81d595f640c4fe91d62e651c5a3761cc1968589d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749505512","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154522/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749505512","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154522/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749505512"}}],"name":"Dillo's Dilemma","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>